{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/brutindia/posts/back-in-2020-kunal-kamra-spoke-out-about-political-jokes-and-receiving-hate-as-a/1234822102163264/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/brutindia/videos/kunal-kamra-doesnt-care-about-hate/812107128570724/","title":"38K views · 1.4K reactions | Back in 2020, Kunal Kamra spoke out about political jokes and receiving hate as a comic. | Brut India","description":"Back in 2020, Kunal Kamra spoke out about political jokes and receiving hate as a comic.","language":"en","text":"India has long been at the heart of the global diamond trade, with generations of workers building expertise in cutting and polishing diamonds.\nNow, lab-grown diamonds are opening up new possibilities for the industry, from growing diamonds locally to changing how a new generation thinks about jewellery and luxury.\nWith the Government of India recognising lab-grown diamonds as a key emerging sector for the future, the industry is witnessing a significant shift.\nIn conversation with Pooja Madhavan, founder and managing director of Limelight Diamonds - India's largest lab-grown diamond jewellery brand - we explore the people and ideas shaping this evolving industry.\n#Collab","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":3294.491783000012,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}